---
title: Implemented Forge platform tick
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Generated page adapter
    participant R as Room
    participant C as Character
    participant A as Animator
    participant W as WASM publication
    B->>R: Input edges and elapsed microseconds
    R->>R: Consume EffectiveInput
    R->>C: step with MotionInput
    C->>C: Resolve Q16 motion
    C-->>R: MotionFrame and contact edges
    R->>R: Update objectives
    R->>A: Select same-tick pose
    A-->>R: Selected PlayerPose
    R->>R: Deliver new events
    R-->>W: Completed epoch and tick
    W-->>B: FGS1 world, FGP1 pose, FGC1 diagnostics
    Note over B,W: Q16 y-down simulation becomes Q8 y-up world positions.<br/>The page draws and does not simulate motion.
